WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.200
How is she doing this?

3
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.660
We captured her thunder
cloud, didn't we?

4
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:20.750
You naughty boy!

5
00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:24.960
Nobody treats me like that and
gets away with it, understand?

6
00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.050
Listen, you miserable rodent.

7
00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:30.090
You're going to be punished
for dropping me into the sea,

8
00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:33.800
and it won't be pretty!

9
00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:38.230
What now?

10
00:00:38.230 --> 00:00:40.190
We prepare for the worst.

11
00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:43.360
That old bag
sure has a lot of energy.

12
00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:45.780
She looks even stronger now!

13
00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:52.190
This is no good. We need time.

14
00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:53.940
Let's retreat!

15
00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:55.280
Running away?

16
00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:02.830
<b>The Sweet Bean Code</b>

17
00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:10.430
Hey, Killer. You okay?

18
00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:13.760
Yeah.

19
00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:17.390
Old bat. She sent us
flying a long way.

20
00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:18.680
Felt like it.

21
00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:22.020
But that aside,
where the hell are we?

22
00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:24.730
In the castle,
that's all I've got.

23
00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:25.440
<b>Guest Parlor



Inside

the Castle</b>

24
00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:28.990
And where's Big Mom?

25
00:03:28.990 --> 00:03:30.570
Must've lost us.

26
00:03:30.570 --> 00:03:32.570
That hole she made
is pretty huge.

27
00:03:32.570 --> 00:03:36.160
She knows we're in here, but
she probably doesn't know where.

28
00:03:55.640 --> 00:04:00.600
Little brat!
Get over here, Kid!

29
00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:07.240
I won't be happy until
I split you in two!

30
00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:13.580
Sounds like she's below
us, down a floor or two.

31
00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:15.450
We gotta try to keep her here.

32
00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:18.330
If she teams up with Kaido
again, we're all dead.

33
00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:18.420
I'll send

34
00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:22.210
I'll send her to hell.
Let's finish this!

35
00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:35.220
Straw Sword!

36
00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:38.060
Hm? It can't be.

37
00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:43.100
Hawkins!

38
00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.470
<b>Basil Hawkins "the Magician" of the Worst Generation

Headliner, Beast Pirates</b>

39
00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:50.280
You traitor.

40
00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:55.280
You've got some balls showing
your face in front of us.

41
00:04:55.280 --> 00:04:57.450
Y'think I won't kill you?

42
00:04:57.450 --> 00:05:01.790
I was betrayed by Apoo as well.
We aren't so different.

43
00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:04.630
I merely avoided a fight

44
00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:07.420
that I knew I had
no chance of winning.

45
00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:09.170
Well, aren't you clever!

46
00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:12.220
But you need a spine
to make it on this stage.

47
00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:13.880
You're so weak
you knew you'd lose

48
00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:16.300
before the fight even started?

49
00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:19.390
Then get your ass
off the battlefield!

50
00:05:19.390 --> 00:05:22.230
'Cause some of us
are here to win!

51
00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:28.020
You can't win.
You're lucky to still be alive.

52
00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:30.110
Shut your damn trap.

53
00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:32.240
I'm gonna throw up just
breathing the same air

54
00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:34.160
as a coward like you.

55
00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:38.160
Kid, I'll handle this.

56
00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:49.050
We can't leave
Big Mom unchecked. Just go.

57
00:05:50.630 --> 00:05:52.630
I'll cut him down.

58
00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:58.100
Thanks, partner.

59
00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:02.570
C'mon! Don't let Kid get away!

60
00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:10.160
You're too kind.

61
00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:13.200
I wouldn't stand a chance
against both of you.

62
00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:15.040
Demon Face!

63
00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:25.220
Look at you!

64
00:06:25.220 --> 00:06:27.550
Such a hard-working
little Headliner.

65
00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:32.060
Your master must be proud!
Maybe they'll give you a treat.

66
00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:35.230
Say what you want,
but they'll be your last words.

67
00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:38.860
There's a 92% chance
you'll die here, after all.

68
00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:41.770
Poor, poor Hitokiri Kamazo!

69
00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:43.610
Fortune-telling, huh?

70
00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:46.360
Well, fortune favors the bold!

71
00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:50.450
All right then, Killer.

72
00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:52.280
Best of luck to you.

73
00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:05.880
Screw that.

74
00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:08.630
You can take your
luck and stuff it.

75
00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:11.100
This win will be mine alone.

76
00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:17.480
Are you gonna run me
around all day?

77
00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:19.190
'Cuz I've had enough!

78
00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:23.610
Sorry, but we don't have
room for dinosaurs!

79
00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:30.320
Let's do this. Hit his
weak spots, Usopp!

80
00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:31.450
I'm on it!

81
00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:34.450
You think we're
just gonna give up?

82
00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:36.960
We'll keep fighting,
even if it's not pretty!

83
00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:38.620
First, the temple!

84
00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:40.580
The chin!

85
00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:42.170
The Adam's apple!

86
00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:44.670
Damn you.

87
00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:47.340
You won't stop?
Neither will we!

88
00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:49.840
The eyeball!

89
00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:51.760
The nostril, too!

90
00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:58.310
Get off already!

91
00:07:58.310 --> 00:07:59.640
C'mon, man!

92
00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:01.480
How much more abuse
you gonna take?

93
00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:03.730
You can't be enjoying this!

94
00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:11.780
Try to stay strong, Komachiyo!
I'm sure we'll be there soon!

95
00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:17.160
The Performance Floor stage
should be the perfect spot.

96
00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:19.960
Horselina and her friends gave
a whole ton of Kibi Dango

97
00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:21.670
to the other generals.

98
00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:25.000
On the stage, I can give all of
them an order at the same time!

99
00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:27.880
Then we'll have a bunch
of Gifters on our side!

100
00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:30.930
Because... then I can
finally be useful!

101
00:08:30.930 --> 00:08:33.850
After that, you guys
won't have to protect me.

102
00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:36.600
'Cause it won't matter if I die!

103
00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:40.690
So get me to the stage!

104
00:08:40.690 --> 00:08:43.360
How could you say that,
Tama? You're wrong!

105
00:08:43.360 --> 00:08:45.110
We're here for you!

106
00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:47.240
We won't stop fighting
till our friends in Wano

107
00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:49.070
are finally free!

108
00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:52.620
Let's do this together.

109
00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:57.580
You've got a beautiful young
lady and her older friend

110
00:08:57.580 --> 00:08:58.750
to protect you.

111
00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:02.120
What? Older
than who? I'm only 19!

112
00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:06.540
It's not that I
don't wanna fight.

113
00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:09.630
I wanna help people
just like Big Bro.

114
00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:14.220
I'm trying. But I...
I'm too scared.

115
00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:16.560
I can't take it anymore!

116
00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:36.500
I'm sorry I yelled, Tama.

117
00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:41.880
You don't need
to push yourself anymore.

118
00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:45.380
It's time for me to finish this.

119
00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:46.800
Do it, Usopp!

120
00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:50.430
One lizard-buster
coming right up!

121
00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:53.890
I'm sick of you!

122
00:09:53.890 --> 00:09:56.480
I'm gonna pull that
stupid nose off your face

123
00:09:56.480 --> 00:09:58.440
and snap it in two!

124
00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:01.020
Special Attack! Green Star! Go!

125
00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:04.030
Huh?

126
00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:08.120
Huh?! Are you just doing
this crap to piss me off?

127
00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:10.450
Firework Flowers!

128
00:10:20.380 --> 00:10:23.550
It's so hot!
Careful with that, Usopp!

129
00:10:23.550 --> 00:10:24.760
Sorry!

130
00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:26.720
It's the best close-range
weapon I've got!

131
00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:29.220
But don't worry!
I'll finish him now!

132
00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:33.640
Special Attack! Green Star! Go!

133
00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:40.650
I wish Kibi Dango
worked on that maniac.

134
00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:42.530
It only works with SMILE fruits,

135
00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:45.400
but what do we do
if he comes back?

136
00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:53.060
Come out, Kid! Where are you?!

137
00:11:56.940 --> 00:12:01.780
– No! It's Big Mom!
– No! It's Big Mom!

138
00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:02.490
<b>On the Roof</b>

139
00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:09.340
Huh? Weird. I guess I'm free.

140
00:12:09.340 --> 00:12:10.720
Now where's Mama?

141
00:12:10.720 --> 00:12:14.380
Mama! I'm here!
Where did you go?

142
00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:18.260
I'll find you!
I'm coming! Just wait!

143
00:12:29.980 --> 00:12:31.360
Mama, please!

144
00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:34.990
Why won't you answer me?
I wanna help!

145
00:12:35.910 --> 00:12:38.530
Did Eustass' power stop working?

146
00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:41.910
We finally broke up
Kaido and Big Mom.

147
00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:45.040
It'll be a pain if she comes
back for that thundercloud.

148
00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:51.540
Straw Hat! I'm taking everyone
downstairs while you get Kaido!

149
00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:55.600
Straw Hat! I'm taking everyone
downstairs while you get Kaido.

150
00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:56.790
Okay.

151
00:13:13.220 --> 00:13:16.200
Having fun, are you?

152
00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:20.160
The more dangerous it gets,

153
00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:23.110
the more that smile
of yours grows.

154
00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:10.620
<b>Connecting Hallway

From Treasury 2F to Castle 3F</b>

155
00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:27.710
Kiku, does your shoulder hurt?

156
00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:29.990
Do not ask such
things of a samurai.

157
00:14:29.990 --> 00:14:34.490
It is naught but an itch
I cannot scratch.

158
00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:36.910
Much like the itch
upon mine heart

159
00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:39.700
that appeared the day
you left home.

160
00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:50.990
If you're well enough to
tease me, that's good news.

161
00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:52.450
But I really am sorry.

162
00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:52.470
I shouldn't have left
without telling you.

163
00:14:52.470 --> 00:14:53.530
I

164
00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:58.560
If the Land of Wano
is truly opened,

165
00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:01.310
how do you think the
country will change?

166
00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:03.270
Can't say.

167
00:15:03.270 --> 00:15:06.820
If we survive, perhaps we'll
discuss it tomorrow morning.

168
00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:10.610
A tall task indeed.

169
00:15:10.610 --> 00:15:14.700
The island is engulfed in
battle. It's win or die.

170
00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:18.080
There must be a shortage
of troops everywhere.

171
00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:20.540
I am confident that I can
protect Lord Momonosuke

172
00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:22.250
on my own.

173
00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:24.920
My opponent will
surely be Kanjuro.

174
00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:26.250
With any luck

175
00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:28.720
I will reach Lord Momonosuke
before he finds him.

176
00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:31.800
This time, Kanjuro
will meet his end!

177
00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:34.260
The rest of you,
go help the others!

178
00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:35.260
Godspeed.

179
00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:37.640
All right. Fare thee well.

180
00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:41.060
Dear friends, let us hope that
we are all reunited soon.

181
00:15:41.060 --> 00:15:44.190
Yeah! C'mon, time's a wastin'!

182
00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:47.150
Right! Good luck!

183
00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:54.240
Master Kin! This is my fault.

184
00:15:54.240 --> 00:15:58.370
Allow me to fight Kanjuro
again! I won't fail!

185
00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:03.790
Kiku. Let us make haste!

186
00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:06.960
Of course!

187
00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:12.550
Goodness! Greetings,
Master Cat Viper!

188
00:16:12.550 --> 00:16:15.140
I knew it was you!

189
00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:19.750
<b>Captain of Inuarashi's Musketeers</b>

190
00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:19.750
<b>Mink Recon Squad</b>

191
00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:19.750
<b>Bariete</b>
<b>Shishilian</b>

192
00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:21.940
Where are you dashing off to?

193
00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:24.350
Never mind that, sir!
We could use some help!

194
00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:28.520
The thing is... Pedro...

195
00:16:35.450 --> 00:16:39.130
Pedro is dead? Surely not!

196
00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:42.750
He is. He died fighting
in Big Mom's territory.

197
00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:45.550
He sacrificed himself
to protect Luffy's crew.

198
00:16:45.550 --> 00:16:49.760
They wouldn't be here
if it wasn't for him.

199
00:16:49.760 --> 00:16:55.560
Well, Pedro. Good job.
It seems you-gara died a hero.

200
00:16:55.560 --> 00:16:58.730
And the bastard responsible
for his death is here?

201
00:16:58.730 --> 00:16:59.940
Uh-huh!

202
00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:02.360
It would be banas if
we let him get off easy!

203
00:17:02.360 --> 00:17:04.690
He's quite formidable.

204
00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:08.610
Wanda and Carrot
are fighting him now.

205
00:17:08.610 --> 00:17:12.490
We'll give a good
thrashing for Pedro!

206
00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:20.500
Where are you going?!

207
00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:22.750
Master!

208
00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:23.750
Huh?

209
00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:26.090
Whoa!

210
00:17:26.090 --> 00:17:27.920
That cat's flying!

211
00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:35.580
<b>Crawl Space


First Floor

Inside the Castle</b>

212
00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:38.440
Both of you,

213
00:17:38.440 --> 00:17:41.860
once I'm gone,
watch out for the Marys.

214
00:17:41.860 --> 00:17:43.820
They're roaming
around Onigashima,

215
00:17:43.820 --> 00:17:44.860
doing recon for Kaido
and his men!

216
00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:47.780
What? They're here?
Where are they?!

217
00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:50.030
Don't worry! I made this!

218
00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:52.790
It's you.

219
00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:54.120
Seriously?!

220
00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:57.710
It's a perfect likeness.
A perfect decoy!

221
00:17:57.710 --> 00:18:00.670
You're the target, but they're
looking for us both.

222
00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:03.500
As long as they think we're
together, they'll come after me!

223
00:18:05.220 --> 00:18:07.100
Sounds like you're
sick of this tiny room

224
00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:09.640
and you're looking for
an excuse to fight.

225
00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:11.480
It's fine, Yamato.

226
00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:15.060
Master Kin can protect us,
and he's on his way here.

227
00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:15.760
For now, Lord Momonosuke
can count on me!

228
00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:22.350
See ya soon! You've got this!

229
00:18:25.780 --> 00:18:29.370
Oh, wait. Hey, Momonosuke.

230
00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:32.170
You said you could hear
Luffy's voice, right?

231
00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:34.710
How is he?

232
00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:39.710
It seems he's all right.
It hasn't changed from earlier.

233
00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:42.220
He's not using
his full strength.

234
00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:47.930
Wait... I'm hearing
a second voice!

235
00:18:51.590 --> 00:18:54.550
I'm sure that's Kaido.

236
00:18:54.550 --> 00:18:57.550
If Luffy's fighting him alone,
this could get ugly!

237
00:18:57.550 --> 00:18:59.760
I must hurry!

238
00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:08.250
Oden's Travel Record

239
00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:09.640
Everything's here.

240
00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:13.010
All the details of my
father's adventures.

241
00:19:13.010 --> 00:19:17.470
I've heard tales of his
exploits many times over.

242
00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:20.810
But to actually
read his words...

243
00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:32.060
Well, I'll be!

244
00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:36.770
The Cat Burglar and
the long-nosed fool!

245
00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:41.940
– Ahh! She's gonna kill us!
– Ahh! She's gonna kill us!

246
00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:45.030
Did Straw Hat bring
the whole damn crew?

247
00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:46.860
Hi,

248
00:19:50.630 --> 00:19:56.180
I'm so happy to see
you, little one!

249
00:19:56.680 --> 00:19:58.850
But this place is
very dangerous.

250
00:19:58.850 --> 00:20:01.370
Why in the world
would you come here?

251
00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:04.380
I've been worried about you
since we split up, Olin!

252
00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:06.960
You just disappeared
back in Udon!

253
00:20:10.050 --> 00:20:11.640
I'm sorry, dear.

254
00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:13.720
It's a scary world
for a little girl,

255
00:20:13.720 --> 00:20:15.890
and I've been worried
about you, too!

256
00:20:15.890 --> 00:20:17.770
Don't worry, I'm not mad!

257
00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:20.020
I'm just happy to see you again!

258
00:20:20.850 --> 00:20:23.060
I never got to
thank you properly!

259
00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:25.860
You took care of me
when I lost my memory.

260
00:20:25.860 --> 00:20:28.230
Woo-hoo! So that
means you got it back?

261
00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:30.070
That's wonderful!

262
00:20:30.070 --> 00:20:31.240
Uh-huh!

263
00:20:31.950 --> 00:20:33.820
Oh, no.

264
00:20:33.820 --> 00:20:35.870
Momma went into "Mother Mode."

265
00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:39.290
This happens every time
she's around kids under ten.

266
00:20:40.410 --> 00:20:43.330
Whoa, let's be careful, Otama!

267
00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:45.380
I-I think they're
friends, somehow!

268
00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:47.590
That kimono looks great on you!

269
00:20:47.590 --> 00:20:49.130
You think so?

270
00:20:49.130 --> 00:20:52.380
See my hairpin? It's cute, too!

271
00:20:52.760 --> 00:20:55.390
Otama! Make her go away!

272
00:20:56.220 --> 00:21:01.220
Say, that woman who
did my hair before... Uh...

273
00:21:01.220 --> 00:21:02.980
She was a real busybody.

274
00:21:02.980 --> 00:21:06.900
Lived in Okobore Town?
Seemed really poor?

275
00:21:06.900 --> 00:21:11.650
Oh! Otsuru, right?
How's she doing these days?

276
00:21:13.450 --> 00:21:18.120
I'll never forget my first taste
of oshiruko that lovely day!

277
00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:22.590
It's so yummy! I wish
I could eat it again.

278
00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:25.300
Something happened actually.

279
00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:32.050
To Okobore Town, I mean.
It's all gone now.

280
00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:35.150
Gone? What do you
mean by that?

281
00:21:35.150 --> 00:21:36.320
The people there lied

282
00:21:36.320 --> 00:21:38.820
and said they stole
food from Kaido,

283
00:21:38.820 --> 00:21:42.700
but it was actually the samurai
who took it before the raid.

284
00:21:44.370 --> 00:21:47.200
But Kaido's men
didn't think twice.

285
00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:49.960
They burned down the
whole town that day.

286
00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:53.040
Here,

287
00:22:03.970 --> 00:22:08.020
They're rebels!
Don't let them get away!

288
00:22:08.020 --> 00:22:10.890
Burn them along with the town!

289
00:22:19.360 --> 00:22:21.150
You look gorgeous, Olin.

290
00:22:21.150 --> 00:22:22.860
You're going to love it.

291
00:22:22.860 --> 00:22:24.240
I can't wait!

292
00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:25.990
It's so cute!

293
00:22:28.030 --> 00:22:30.370
Kaido's men killed them?

294
00:22:30.370 --> 00:22:32.540
Don't let them get away!

295
00:22:32.800 --> 00:22:35.890
Burn them along with the town!

296
00:22:46.490 --> 00:22:48.320
We were strangers,

297
00:22:48.320 --> 00:22:51.780
but they cared for me
when I lost my memory.

298
00:22:53.290 --> 00:22:55.080
Bye, Olin!

299
00:23:00.390 --> 00:23:02.880
Those poor people.

300
00:23:03.890 --> 00:23:06.900
They had so little
in Okobore Town,

301
00:23:06.900 --> 00:23:09.680
but they shared with me anyway.

302
00:23:12.030 --> 00:23:15.060
And you rewarded
them with death?

303
00:23:16.560 --> 00:23:19.900
I totally forgot about
the lizard guy!

304
00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:23.380
We're done for!

305
00:23:23.380 --> 00:23:25.210
Komachiyo, let's go, boy!

306
00:23:25.210 --> 00:23:26.880
Hey, Big Mom!

307
00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:30.760
Don't let those little
cowards get past you!

308
00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:35.850
Let's run! Must go faster!

309
00:23:41.390 --> 00:23:45.390
Too slow! Time to say goodbye!

310
00:23:52.710 --> 00:23:55.370
You spineless goons!

311
00:23:59.460 --> 00:24:03.340
We pirates live in
a world of villainy and vice.

312
00:24:03.340 --> 00:24:07.170
But we still have
honor and justice!

313
00:24:18.350 --> 00:24:21.060
Damn you!

314
00:24:21.060 --> 00:24:22.980
You first!

315
00:24:23.940 --> 00:24:25.900
Ulti!

316
00:24:30.740 --> 00:24:33.360
That was her. It has to be!

317
00:24:33.360 --> 00:24:37.540
Ah! It's Mama!
I'm so happy she's safe!

318
00:24:39.160 --> 00:24:41.120
Are you okay, Komachiyo?

319
00:24:41.120 --> 00:24:43.120
We gotta keep going!
